+# Flightdeck's EAPPX source import
+
+Library sources and tests originate from tuxuser/eappx-rs revision
+`e39222821f8004c663f61a917304e8f5f679b224`:
+https://github.com/tuxuser/eappx-rs/tree/e39222821f8004c663f61a917304e8f5f679b224
+
+The original MIT license is retained in LICENSE. Flightdeck updates xmlserde
+and its derives together so blockmaps and both manifest forms use a corrected
+XML parser. The library is part of the Xodus workspace; the upstream makeappx
+demonstration binary is omitted. Extraction is performed through Flightdeck's
+contained output writer rather than this library's legacy filesystem helpers.
