+# Flightdeck's XAL source import
+
+Library sources and tests originate from xodus-gaming/xal-rs revision
+`6aa2420f8f0d5e6f7460ff13f399037583a942f4`:
+https://github.com/xodus-gaming/xal-rs/tree/6aa2420f8f0d5e6f7460ff13f399037583a942f4
+
+The original MIT license is retained in LICENSE. Flightdeck updates the HTTP
+and OAuth dependencies together and explicitly retains the token transport's
+no-redirect policy. Xbox signature canonicalization is unchanged. The library
+is part of the Xodus workspace; upstream demonstration binaries are omitted.
